@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
autonumber
participant "Source decoder" as Source
participant "Linux runner\nclock + worker handoff" as Host
participant "PresenceMonitor" as Core
participant "Atomic JSON writer" as Writer
participant "Local consumer" as Consumer
Source -> Host : complete compatible observations
Host -> Core : facts, job completion, explicit time
Core --> Host : accepted result + original valid_until
Host -> Writer : atomic replacement
Writer --> Consumer : current record
Consumer -> Consumer : verify clock domain and capture age
Source -> Host : later gap / receiver dropout
Host -> Core : new-input failure facts
Core --> Host : retain independently eligible prior;\nseparate bounded diagnostics; same deadline
Host -> Writer : atomic replacement
alt runner processes expiry
 Host -> Core : timer now > original valid_until
 Core --> Host : unknown / evidence_expired;\nlast_known is history
 Host -> Writer : atomic replacement
 Writer --> Consumer : unknown current record
else publisher unavailable or stalled
 Consumer -> Consumer : own expiry check fails;\nunknown even if old file readable
end
Source -> Host : new evidence with epochs / time mapping
Host -> Core : facts, qualified-job outcome, explicit time
Core --> Host : accepted new result or unknown;\nnew horizon only from new capture
Host -> Writer : atomic replacement
@enduml
